":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nc6d130abd9188f313e6701d01a0ddd6ea32166a0\n\n### System information\n\nArch Linux\n\n### Issue description\n\nAttempting to draw a freed MultiMesh crashes the engine. Simply have the resource be valid within the scope of the `_draw()` function only and the crash will happen.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the MRP. The crash will happen immediately.\n\nThe offending code:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _draw() -> void:\n        draw_multimesh(MultiMesh.new(), null)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[DrawMultiMeshCrash.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21201868/DrawMultiMeshCrash.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108566/timeline","performed